# Dauntless Scrapbot: "When this creature enters, exile each opponent's graveyard. Create a Lander token." Turn 1 Bot1 Bolts
# Bot2, so its own graveyard holds a Lightning Bolt; Bot2's discards to hand size fill its graveyard with two Islands by
# turn 5. On turn 5 the Scrapbot enters: both Islands are exiled, Bot1's Bolt is not (only opponents' graveyards), and a Lander
# token (an artifact) arrives under Bot1's control.

